## 1. Structure

Six files, TypeScript, no framework, run via `npx tsx`. **No `package.json` or `tsconfig.json` in this folder** — it inherits from the repo root (`host-runtime.ts:10` refers to "Node >=18 per package.json engines", so the root manifest owns engines).

