**There are none.** No `package.json`, `pyproject.toml`, `tsconfig.json`, `connection.yaml`/`.json`, or manifest of any kind in this directory — I probed for all of them. Outputs/streams/resources are defined *only* by the TypeScript types in `types.ts` and the re-exports in `contract.ts`.

Config is passed in at call time as `EmailSourceConfig` rather than declared in a file — deliberately, so the folder never touches a credential store. The one indirect reference is `host-runtime.ts:10` citing "Node >=18 per package.json engines", pointing at a repo-root `package.json` outside this folder (also EPERM for me). Build/test commands live in `README.md:85-88`:
