{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01TYBH1TmuCze2oPpfRDXdNi","type":"tool_result","content":"1	/**
2	 * หน้าที่: proves the EMAIL INPUT ADAPTER (a) reimplements no Gmail
