| `.../email-alert-source/adapter.ts` | the one HTTP call + `translate()` |
| `.../email-alert-source/types.ts` | all type contracts |
| `.../email-alert-source/host-runtime.ts` | private `httpPostJson` + `nowIso` |
| `.../email-alert-source/tests/adapter.test.ts` | hand-rolled test harness |
